CHAPTER.VERS:
And he said, If now I have found grace in thy sight, O Lord, let my Lord, I pray thee, go among us; 

          Seeing the people are of this nature, the rulers need to call on God that he would always be present with his Spirit.
         for it [is] a stiffnecked people; and pardon our iniquity and our sin, and take us for thine inheritance.
